= Internal Factions of HaAvoda

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Progressives are interested in social justice, Jewish-Arab cooperation, and a two-state solution.">Progressive</span>!} strength: [+ left_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ left_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Laborist faction supports returning Israel to its Socialist roots and empowering the Histadrut.">Laborist</span>!} strength: [+ center_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ center_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Liberals support the socially liberal policies of the party, while taking more centrist positions on the economy and two-state solution.">Liberal</span>!} strength: [+ labor_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ labor_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Moderates support the welfare state, two-state solution, political reform like the Progressives, while being more pragmatic in government like the Liberals.">Moderate</span>!} strength: [+ reformist_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ reformist_dissent : dissent +]

